	—featuring 3 days of original and moving live concert and dance performanc
	es—in The Brown Theater at Wortham Center. \nEach individual performance i
	s unique\, featuring different musicians\, performers\, and more. \nHousto
	n Mariachi Festival 2026 Schedule\nTogether\, the 3 weekend performances s
	howcase local rising Houston talents\, world renowned professional mariach
	i ensembles and dance troupes\, and national champions from the University
	 of Texas Rio Grande Valley. \n\nUniversity of Houston Mariachi Pumas & Mo
	re | Friday\, August 28 – $35+ 7pm. Get tickets.\nMariachi Imperial de Ame
	rica & More | Saturday\, August 29 – $35+. 7pm. Get tickets.\nUniversity o
	f Texas Rio Grande Valley Mariachi Aztlan & More | Sunday\, August 30 – $3
	5+. 3pm. Get tickets.\n\nAdmission\nTickets start at $35 for each performa
	nce. Get tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sp
	onsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and
	 more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, bu
