DESCRIPTION:Discover how to turn your outdoor space into a haven for local 
	and migrating birds. Participants will learn how native plants support bir
	ds by providing essential food\, shelter\, and nesting resources. The prog
	ram will include a guided garden walk\, practical habitat-building tips\, 
	and a hands-on activity to help guests begin creating their own bird-frien
	dly space. \nThursday\, Sept. 24\n6:30 – 7:30 p.m.\nMcGovern Centennial Ga
	rdens – Family Garden (1500 Hermann Drive\, Houston\, TX 77004) \nRSVP FOR
